an begin="00:34.005" end="00:35.250">sentience </span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.442">is </span><span begin="00:35.442" end="00:35.730">not </span><span begin="00:35.730" end="00:36.466">quite </span><span begin="00:36.466" end="00:36.898">what </span><span begin="00:36.898" end="00:37.490">it </span><span begin="00:37.490" end="00:38.722">seems</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.378" end="00:45.026"><span begin="00:41.378" end="00:41.810">When </span><span begin="00:41.810" end="00:42.323">we </span><span begin="00:42.323" end="00:42.802">last </span><span begin="00:42.802" end="00:43.666">wrote</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.026" end="00:48.889"><span begin="00:45.026" end="00:45.234">It </span><span begin="00:45.234" end="00:45.426">was </span><span begin="00:45.426" end="00:45.746">the </span><span begin="00:45.746" end="00:46.274">sun </span><span begin="00:46.274" end="00:46.698">and </span><span begin="00:46.698" end="00:47.609">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.889" end="00:50.761"><span begin="00:48.889" end="00:49.113">With </span><span begin="00:49.113" end="00:49.353">cliffs </span><span begin="00:49.353" end="00:49.641">as </span><span begin="00:49.641" end="00:50.169">high</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.761" end="00:53.043"><span begin="00:50.761" end="00:50.985">And </span><span begin="00:50.985" end="00:51.321">fears </span><span begin="00:51.321" end="00:51.881">as </span><span begin="00:51.881" end="00:52.787">deep</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.043" end="00:56.142"><span begin="00:53.043" end="00:53.251">With </span><span begin="00:53.251" end="00:53.838">my </span><span begin="00:54.206" end="00:54.878">magnum </span><span begin="00:54.878" end="00:55.662">opus</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.142" end="01:02.883"><span begin="00:56.142" end="00:56.334">My </span><span begin="00:56.334" end="00:56.862">starry-</span><span begin="00:56.862" end="00:57.486">eyed </span><span begin="00:57.486" end="00:59.619">recitative</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.883" end="01:07.798"><span begin="01:02.883" end="01:03.123">The </span><span begin="01:03.123" end="01:03.358">color </span><span begin="01:03.358" end="01:03.582">on </span><span begin="01:03.582" end="01:03.758">these </span><span begin="01:03.758" end="01:05.302">trees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.798" end="01:13.718"><span begin="01:07.798" end="01:07.990">It's </span><span begin="01:07.990" end="01:08.150">like </span><span begin="01:08.150" end="01:09.030">something </span><span begin="01:09.030" end="01:09.238">from </span><span begin="01:09.238" end="01:09.414">a </span><span begin="01:09.414" end="01:10.742">movie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.718" end="01:18.385"><span begin="01:13.718" end="01:13.990">Last </span><span begin="01:13.990" end="01:14.262">night </span><span begin="01:14.262" end="01:14.705">I </span><span begin="01:14.705" end="01:16.449">smiled</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.385" end="01:21.482"><span begin="01:18.385" end="01:18.593">While </span><span begin="01:18.593" end="01:19.470">laughing </span><span begin="01:19.470" end="01:19.678">at </span><span begin="01:19.678" end="01:19.838">a </span><span begin="01:19.838" end="01:21.194">moonbeam</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.482" end="01:33.711"><span begin="01:21.482" end="01:21.674">We're </span><span begin="01:21.674" end="01:22.122">all </span><span begin="01:22.122" end="01:23.210">moving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.711" end="01:37.343"><span begin="01:33.711" end="01:34.111">I </span><span begin="01:34.111" end="01:34.623">felt </span><span begin="01:34.623" end="01:35.999">awoke</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.343" end="01:41.542"><span begin="01:37.343" end="01:37.567">Our </span><span begin="01:37.567" end="01:38.079">summer </span><span begin="01:38.079" end="01:38.959">music </span><span begin="01:38.959" end="01:39.999">spree</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.542" end="01:47.126"><span begin="01:41.542" end="01:41.734">My </span><span begin="01:41.734" end="01:42.982">reflections </span><span begin="01:42.982" end="01:43.382">on </span><span begin="01:43.382" end="01:43.750">being </span><span begin="01:43.750" end="01:44.198">cut </span><span begin="01:44.198" end="01:45.302">free</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.126" end="01:54.616"><span begin="01:47.126" end="01:47.318">It's </span><span begin="01:47.318" end="01:47.862">turning </span><span begin="01:47.862" end="01:48.230">out </span><span begin="01:48.230" end="01:48.454">to </span><span begin="01:48.454" end="01:49.136">be </span><span begin="01:49.136" end="01:49.664">the </span><span begin="01:49.664" end="01:50.192">strength </span><span begin="01:50.192" end="01:50.688">I </span><span begin="01:50.688" end="01:51.624">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.616" end="01:58.344"><span begin="01:54.616" end="01:55.064">I </span><span begin="01:55.064" end="01:55.528">hope </span><span begin="01:55.528" end="01:56.072">you </span><span begin="01:56.072" end="01:57.480">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.344" end="02:02.220"><span begin="01:58.344" end="01:58.548">That </span><span begin="01:58.548" end="01:58.884">there's </span><span begin="01:58.884" end="01:59.371">still </span><span begin="01:59.371" end="01:59.675">joy </span><span begin="01:59.675" end="01:59.995">for </span><span begin="01:59.995" end="02:01.036">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.220" end="02:04.157"><span begin="02:02.220" end="02:02.428">In </span><span begin="02:02.428" end="02:02.892">fleeting </span><span begin="02:02.892" end="02:03.756">moments</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.157" end="02:07.532"><span begin="02:04.157" end="02:04.348">I </span><span begin="02:04.348" end="02:04.748">take </span><span begin="02:04.748" end="02:06.236">relief</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.532" end="02:11.292"><span begin="02:07.532" end="02:07.756">In </span><span begin="02:07.756" end="02:07.932">my </span><span begin="02:07.932" end="02:09.085">suspicion </span><span begin="02:09.085" end="02:09.388">that </span><span begin="02:09.388" end="02:09.660">these </span><span begin="02:09.660" end="02:10.156">past </span><span begin="02:10.156" end="02:11.004">months</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.292" end="02:16.108"><span begin="02:11.292" end="02:11.500">Were </span><span begin="02:11.500" end="02:11.820">a </span><span begin="02:11.820" end="02:12.844">dream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.108" end="02:21.092"><span begin="02:16.108" end="02:16.396">You </span><span begin="02:16.396" end="02:16.668">should </span><span begin="02:16.668" end="02:16.892">see </span><span begin="02:16.892" end="02:17.572">these </span><span begin="02:17.572" end="02:19.108">trees</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.092" end="02:26.940"><span begin="02:21.092" end="02:21.284">It's </span><span begin="02:21.284" end="02:21.444">like </span><span begin="02:21.444" end="02:22.308">something </span><span begin="02:22.308" end="02:22.564">from </span><span begin="02:22.564" end="02:22.756">a </span><span begin="02:22.756" end="02:24.068">movie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.940" end="02:31.484"><span begin="02:26.940" end="02:27.212">And </span><span begin="02:27.212" end="02:27.484">when </span><span begin="02:27.484" end="02:28.044">she </span><span begin="02:28.044" end="02:29.564">smiles</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.484" end="02:34.871"><span begin="02:31.484" end="02:31.724">The </span><span begin="02:31.724" end="02:32.252">earth's </span><span begin="02:32.252" end="02:32.684">no </span><span begin="02:32.684" end="02:33.196">longer </span><span begin="02:33.196" end="02:34.599">moving</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.871" end="02:37.287"><span begin="02:34.871" end="02:35.063">The </span><span begin="02:35.063" end="02:35.415">thought's </spa